      "id": "faq1",
      "question": "What is the typical turnaround time for wedding photos and films?",
      "answer": "We deliver a teaser within 7-10 days of the event. The complete set of high-resolution edited images and the final cinematic wedding film are delivered in 6 to 8 weeks, depending on the scope of post-production.",
