      "id": "faq3",
      "question": "Can we customize the pricing packages?",
      "answer": "Absolutely. Every event has unique requirements. We offer three pre-designed packages, but we frequently customize them to include specific deliverables like live-streaming, additional shooting days, or designer albums.",
